# 🎙️ Customer insights audit

## Executive Overview & Purpose

Raw customer feedback (ad comments, review platforms, transcript analysis, and social discussions) contains essential growth signals. However, raw feedback is often noisy, fragmented, and unorganized. 

This outlines a repeatable, 5-step process to harvest, clean, tag, and synthesize high-volume VoC data. The resulting insights feed directly into the **Persona Matrix (`Doc 1`)** and **Persona Translation Engine (`Doc 3`)**.

