## 📑 Pre-Launch VoC Verification Checklist

- [ ] **Data Cleaning:** Have all product names, brand specifics, and proprietary details been standardized or generalized?
- [ ] **Taxonomy Consistency:** Does the hook label match an established taxonomy category before a new label is created?
- [ ] **Data Verification:** Are CTR, CPA, and conversion metrics calculated using standardized platform definitions?
